---
<Layout title="Contact" description="Get in touch, or find me on GitHub, LinkedIn, HackerOne, and other profiles.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-white">Contact</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      The fastest way to reach me is email. I'm also reachable (and more active) on the profiles below —
      for vulnerability reports, please use the relevant disclosure program rather than a DM where possible.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {SOCIAL_LINKS.map((link) => (
        <a
          href={link.href}
          class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 p-4 transition hover:border-accent-300 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-stone-800 dark:hover:border-accent-700"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">
            <path d={icons[link.icon]} />
          </svg>
          <span class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-white">{link.label}</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-5 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:border-stone-800 dark:bg-stone-900 dark:text-stone-400">
      <p class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-white">Responsible disclosure</p>
      <p class="mt-1">
        If you found a vulnerability in a tool published on this site, please open a private security advisory
        or issue on the relevant GitHub repository rather than disclosing publicly first.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
